    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sheriff</strong> is called to the\u00a0<strong>lawless town of Red Rock</strong>, where a\u00a0string of <strong>brutal crimes</strong> and\u00a0<strong>unsettling mysteries</strong> have left <strong>the\u00a0townsfolk terrified</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he digs\u00a0deeper, <strong>dark secrets and danger\u00a0</strong>await at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439500/extras/84e23be4fc2bed9c59e3f5b2e3ad9956.avif?t=1741786261\" data-has-big width=800 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a sheriff solving AI-generated cases with unique clues, suspects, and NPC relationships in every playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your way of interacting and solving the crimes in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439500/extras/81f71b477dd9578dc339c375ecfacc4c.poster.avif?t=1741786261\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439500/extras/81f71b477dd9578dc339c375ecfacc4c.webm?t=1741786261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439500/extras/81f71b477dd9578dc339c375ecfacc4c.mp4?t=1741786261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock cases and travel in the old West to solve the mysteries!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http